# As is
In class `Sum` in `kakiage/src/nn/core.ts`, the arguments of function was lacked.

```
  async forward([x]: Tensor[]): Promise<Tensor[]> {
    return genCall([x], {
      all: (c, [t]) => [c.sum(t)],
    });
  }
```

# To be

Arguments of axis and keepdims was added.

```
  async forward([x]: Tensor[]): Promise<Tensor[]> {
    return genCall([x], {
      all: (c, [t]) => [c.sum(t, this.axis, this.keepdims)],
    });
  }
```

